a to practice  blocking with him and some of the other  players after practice  hinata thinks that he is trying to give  him a chance to play but it's revealed  that tsukushima wants to play against  hinata  because he is a spiker that can actually  see the blockers and give him a  challenge  of course fukushima is never going to  say that cause he's a dick who doesn't  like to give compliments  kagayama to no one's surprise is syncing  up well with the others and his camp and  proves that he is more than capable  of keeping up with all of them there are  a couple of players that stand out  though including korrai hoshioumi  hoshiyumi is much like hinata and the  little giant in the sense that he is  very short but is still  one of the best players at the camp we  also meet another threat  in the second year setter mia atsumu who  causes friction with kagayama calling  him a goody two shoes  anyways back on over to hinata where the  guys are doing 2v2 matches  one of the players you die yakuzawa is  getting really discouraged  and ends up saying that he wishes hinata  was invited instead of him  he not a scolds him for being ungrateful  for the opportunity and then gives him  some advice on how to take it easy which  improves his performance episode 5.  we see that goody two-shoes comment  makes kagiyama reflect on being the  tyrant king and it starts to affect his  play  meanwhile at hinata's camp the  upperclassmen come back for another  skirmish with the guys  hinata tries learning everything he can  from the other players including  wakatoshi  kagiyama manages to snap out of his funk  and starts playing like himself again  after practice he asks mia what he meant  when he called him a goody two two-shoes  he just responds to that kagiyama is  serious honest and an all-around good  kid  which is pretty vague and doesn't  [ __ ] help the camp comes to an end  and everybody parts ways until they meet  again  at nationals hinata's camp ends also and  we see kagiyama's old teammate hajime  asking about kagiyama and seems to have  gotten over him being the tyrant king  when they play together  episode 6. the gang is all reunited  after the camps and work on their serves  where hinata shows off his new split  step move  we also see kagiyama give hinata tips on  how to jump higher by shifting his  weight to different parts of his feet  which is what hoshi umi was doing  dante tech then arrives for a practice  match where they show that their iron  wall defense is as good as ever they  continuously read and block kagayama  sets which gets him pumped up to be  getting to play against so many strong  teams  ye episode 7 during one of the plays  kagiyama gets kind of annoyed and says  that nishinoya was in the way of the  back attackers  normally nobody ever has anything really  bad to say to nishinoya and certainly  not like that  ever since he's gotten back from camp  kagayama has been a little bit more  sinister and everybody seems to be  picking up on it things start to get  even more tense when he starts giving  tsukushima orders also  the big teddy bear asahi is next on  kagayama's hit list when he snaps on him  for missing an easy point that costs  them the first set  fukushima being the confrontational dick  he is makes a comment about this being  the return of the king but when kagayama  goes to apologize hinata stops him he  says that kagayama should voice what  he's thinking and that if him or the  others don't like it then just don't  listen forehead  everyone points out that it's really  more about how he delivers the criticism  kagiyama seems to be trying to find a  middle ground between the king and goody  two-shoes where he can speak his mind  without pissing everybody off  he also decides to not use his skill to  compensate for spiker's bad habits and  instead force them to spike correctly  which is what he does with tsukushima  this doesn't really work out since they  aren't exactly used to this style and  they end up losing the second set also  everyone can see that the communication  is in the middle of an evolution with  all of the players learning the proper  ways to give and receive feedback with  kagiyama  episode 8 god asuno manages to win the  third set thanks to hinata drawing so  much attention from the blockers  creating openings for the others  we also see kagiyama getting more  conscientious of how other players are  doing like tsukushima getting really  tired and learning how to play around  that we get another scene of hinata's  instincts being improved and how he's  able to now bait blockers to him more  effectively  asahi shows a lot more confidence in the  face of the iron wall which used to  intimidate him and was also the reason  he quit in the prior seasons  he uses the newfound confidence to score  the winning point giving them  their final win in the practice matches  episode 9.  on new year's day the katasuna  upperclassmen seem a little on edge but  a visit to a shrine helps them get in  the right mindset for nationals the  filler content continues as the night  before  the tournament rolls around and everyone  is dealing with their nerves for the big  day in different ways  when they arrive for the first day  kagayama reconvenes with some of the  players from his training camp we also  get the reunion of katasuno with their  rivals in nekoma high and fukurodani  right before all of the teams make their  entrance to finally get things underway  episode 10. the team travels to another  local gym to get warmed up while the  other matches are going on  when they return hinata realizes that he  had lost his bag  so his shoes are missing his phone was  also in the bag so when they call it a  kid answers and explains that he grabs  hinata's bag by accident the kid and his  mom agree to wait at the gym so kyoko  runs down there with the kids bag  in order to make the exchange while this  is going on we get some backstory on  kyoko who used to be on the track team  before she joined as manager of the  volleyball team  her riot ends up leaving so she has to  rely on her speed instead to get her  back  just in time to get hinata his shoes  their first match is against  subakihata where they fall behind early  on because kagayama needs some time to  find his groove in the match  things are still looking rough with  kagiyama's play so tarashi makes an  early substitution to give him a chance  to reset  this works out as kagiyama comes online  and hinata nails their first quick of  the tournament  episode 11. it's not just kagiyama  making his mark but tsukushima is  exerting a lot of pressure onto the  attackers as well  hinata is also relying less on his  instincts and actually reading the  players to see where the ball will go  leading to some clutch saves it's still  a bit of a work in progress  because the ball is just bouncing off  his chest or face when he does it but  the thought is there sad character  nobody cares about kinoshita comes in to  [ __ ] up a serve and then is immediately  benched again  on match point in the first set tsubaki  had his pinch server himekawa chokes his  underhand serve pretty badly nailing his  teammate in the back of the head and  gifting the first set to katasuno this  just goes to show that every team has a  useless yamaguchi  his redemption arc ensues in the second  set where katasuno is leading but hime  cow was unorthodox underhand serves gets  them some easy points and the lead  kodasuno brings it to match point for  the second set and sugawata is subbed in  a long rally ensues and eventually asahi  is the one to put it away ending the set  and the match  with katasunu as the winners  episode 12. we get a quick look at  fukurodani whose drama queen ace is  already off his game because he wanted  to play in the main  arena instead of the subarena with their  match over katasuna heads over to watch  nekoma play where they take an early win  against kyokawa  back to fukurodani who try 