h so  that's just one more thing that they  have to keep in mind during their match  ganuka clears out the cousin  misunderstanding but they are both too  focused on their upcoming games so  neither of them pulls the trigger just  yet their second match gets underway  where kia gets an early lead with his  serves while asahi messes up his  this is because the crowd is being kind  of bm they are completely quiet while  mia serves but when katasuno goes to  serve they start booing them hinata then  gets the perfect setup to score in the  last scene but is too focused on his  jump and forgot to actually hit the ball  it's still enough to warrant an  immediate reaction from mia andy  narazaki though realizing that he's a  potential threat i'm gonna be doing the  future seasons and you can find that in  the left side whenever i'm finished with  it or you can check out all of the  haikyuu recaps in the playlist on the  right side you can also find the links  in the description below and the only  thing i hate more than intros  is outros
 

